bilbo forget: take entries out of recall; what they held stays readable.

[1mUsage:[22m
  [36mbilbo forget [39m[2m<ref>[22m[36m...[39m

[2mAn entry gives up its capture label, so its path can be kept again. What[22m
[2mbelongs to it goes with it: its subagents, its notes and its summary.[22m

[1mOutput:[22m
  forgotten [2m<n>[22m, belonging [2m<n>[22m, unchanged [2m<n>[22m

[1mExit:[22m
  [1m0[22m  success, also when every entry named was forgotten already
  [1m1[22m  a ref that names no entry, a store or index failure
  [1m2[22m  usage or config error, or a ref that names several entries

[1mExamples:[22m
  [36mbilbo forget 2T6W9YB0DE[39m

[1mDocs:[22m [2mhttps://github.com/delucca/bilbo/wiki/Commands#forget[22m
